<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Fraser Alexander, Fralex caution on talks.</title>
<headline>Fraser Alexander, Fralex caution on talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fraser Alexander Ltd and Fralex Ltd said on Tuesday that discussions were in progress which could have an impact on their shares and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>They gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
